# Created by venv; see https://docs.python.org/3/library/venv.html
*
# Un-ignore the debug instrumentation package
!debug/
!debug/*
# Un-ignore the backend test suite (same pattern as !debug/ above) — needed so
# tests/test_cost.py, tests/test_geo.py, and this branch's new
# tests/test_chunk_store.py are actually trackable.
!tests/
!tests/*
# Un-ignore the SQL migrations (same pattern) — needed for this branch's new
# 009_review_projects_sp_keymap_estimate_supabase_only.sql.
!migrations/
!migrations/*
# Un-ignore the standalone SQL function files deployed via scripts/deploy_sql.py.
!sql/
!sql/*
# Un-ignore the scripts directory. Every script under it is tracked, so this
# is a directory-level rule rather than a per-file list — a per-file list is
# exactly what silently dropped ingest_specs.py and friends from git (one
# side of a merge never had them tracked because they post-dated this file's
# per-file rules, so the merge kept the "deleted" side with no conflict; see
# the app/ note below for the same class of gap).
!scripts/
!scripts/*
# Un-ignore every app/ subpackage as a directory-level rule (not per-file —
# see the scripts/ note above for why per-file lists are the actual bug
# here). app/ itself must be un-ignored first or git won't look inside it;
# __pycache__ and other build artifacts stay ignored via the blanket rule
# (same pattern as !debug/ above).
!app/
!app/*.py
!app/api/
!app/api/*
!app/compliance/
!app/compliance/*
!app/generation/
!app/generation/*
!app/graph_neo4j/
!app/graph_neo4j/*
!app/ingestion/
!app/ingestion/*
!app/retrieval/
!app/retrieval/*
!app/retrieval_langchain/
!app/retrieval_langchain/*
!app/scheduling/
!app/scheduling/*
# Un-ignore the env var template (no secrets — placeholders only)
!.env.example
